<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9807" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίβῐος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> : (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βία</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>opposing force to force</i>: as Adj. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιβίοις
				ἐπέεσσι</span> with <i>wrangling</i> words, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.415
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὅμιλος</span>”
				<i>hostile,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					624
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			Subst., <i>enemy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				319b
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				2.508
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.114
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίβιον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιβίην, ἀ.
				μαχέσασθαι</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μενελάῳ ἀντίβιον . .
			πολεμίζειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				435
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ μὲν ἀντίβιον . . πειρηθείης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.386
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
